t": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations.", "type": "secondary_8"}]}, {"content": "frn4le12ob05re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Le code vestimentaire", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "Le code vestimentaire est une norme sociale non \u00e9crite qui nous oblige \u00e0 nous habiller diff\u00e9remment selon le cadre dans lequel on se trouve. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Voici une liste de v\u00eatements qui font partie d'une tenue habill\u00e9e (professionnelle) ou d\u00e9contract\u00e9e :", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Habill\u00e9/</br>Professionnel\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"D\u00e9contract\u00e9\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"une chemise \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"frn4le12ob05img01.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"une paire de jeans   \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"frn4le12ob05img06.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"un uniforme\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"frn4le12ob05img02.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"un t-shirt \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"frn4le12ob05img07.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"un costume\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"frn4le12ob05img03.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"des baskets\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"frn4le12ob05img08.jpg\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class = \"prelo-letter-page-break\"></span>", "type": "text"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"un&nbsp;tailleur&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"frn4le12ob05img04.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"un&nbsp;short&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"frn4le12ob05img09.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"une&nbsp;cravate\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"frn4le12ob05img05.jpg\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"des sandales\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"image\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"frn4le12ob05img10.jpg\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "Dans les entreprises fran\u00e7aises, on demande g\u00e9n\u00e9ralement aux employ\u00e9s d'avoir un style habill\u00e9. Certaines d'entre elles autorisent leurs employ\u00e9s \u00e0 s'habiller de fa\u00e7on d\u00e9contract\u00e9e le vendredi (<span class=\"italic\">vendredi d\u00e9contract\u00e9</span> ou <span class=\"italic\">casual friday</span>). ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Dans les \u00e9tablissements scolaires fran\u00e7ais, les \u00e9l\u00e8ves peuvent s'habiller comme ils le souhaitent. La loi fran\u00e7aise oblige cependant \u00e0 ne pas porter de signe marquant une appartenance religieuse. Le r\u00e8glement int\u00e9rieur peut aussi imposer des restrictions au niveau des logos des marques de v\u00eatements ou de ne pas porter des jeans trou\u00e9s ou des jupes et des robes trop courtes.", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le manager", "type": "name"}, {"content": "personne qui a des responsabilit\u00e9s dans une entreprise", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Non, je ne crois pas que le manager ait d\u00e9cid\u00e9.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le12ob05aud01", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"content": "Voici des mots qu'on utilise pour parler des v\u00eatements professionnels. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le candidat, la candidate", "type": "name"}, {"content": "postulant pour un emploi, un examen, une fonction, etc. ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m./f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Il doit il y avoir beaucoup de candidats. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le12ob05aud02", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "l'attente", "type": "name"}, {"content": "action d'attendre quelqu'un, quelque chose", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : L'attente risque d'\u00eatre longue. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le12ob05aud03", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "risquer", "type": "name"}, {"content": "tenter, oser quelque chose", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(verbe)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : L'attente risque d'\u00eatre longue. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le12ob05aud04", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "l'unifome", "type": "name"}, {"content": "habit, v\u00eatement d\u00e9termin\u00e9, obligatoire pour un groupe ", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : On doit porter un uniforme en cuisine.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le12ob05aud05", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la toque", "type": "name"}, {"content": "chapeau que les cuisiniers portent sur la t\u00eate", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Je dois porter une toque blanche. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le12ob05aud06", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "le vendredi d\u00e9contract\u00e9 ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "coutume selon laquelle le personnel d'une entreprise peut s'habiller de mani\u00e8re d\u00e9contract\u00e9e le vendredi", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom m.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : \u00c0 moins que ce ne soit le \"vendredi d\u00e9contract\u00e9\". ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le12ob05aud07", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"content": "la tenue vestimentaire ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "v\u00eatements que l'on porte au travail, etc.", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(nom f.)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Exemple : Le reste de la semaine il faut une tenue vestimentaire professionnelle.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "frn4le12ob05aud08", "type": "audio"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": "Exprimer la possibilit\u00e9 ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": " Pour exprimer la possibilit\u00e9, on utilise le verbe <span class=\"strong italic\">risquer</span> + <span class=\"italic\">de</span> + verbe \u00e0 l'infinitif. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": " L'attente risque d'\u00eatre longue.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "Les grammairiens ne sont pas tous d'accord sur l'utilisation du verbe <span class=\"italic\">risquer</span> dans ce sens-l\u00e0. Certains consid\u00e8rent qu'il ne peut pas \u00eatre utilis\u00e9 sans que le compl\u00e9ment ne comporte une id\u00e9e de danger. Il semblerait malgr\u00e9 tout que cette utilisation soit accept\u00e9e. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Il risque de faire beau demain. ", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"content": "Allez sur Internet et trouvez des informations sur les codes vestimentaires dans trois pays diff\u00e9rents. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Regardez le code vestimentaire au travail. Est-ce qu'une seule tenue vestimentaire professionnelle est autoris\u00e9e ? D\u00e9crivez les habits que les gens portent. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Regardez le code vestimentaire dans la vie de tous les jours. Quand les gens portent-ils des v\u00eatements d\u00e9contract\u00e9s ? ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "\u00c9crivez un paragraphe (8 \u00e0 10 lignes) sur les informations que vous avez trouv\u00e9es. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Lisez le paragraphe \u00e0 voix haute \u00e0 un camarade. ", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"content": "J'identifie le code vestimentaire dans d'autres pays.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je parle des v\u00eatements. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Je d\u00e9cris des tenus vestimentaires.", "type": "text"}]}], "type": "sena"}